{"reviews":[{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-0","r":5.0,"t":"My favorite scent in the world!","x":"I LOVE this clean scent.  I originally purchased it year's ago while traveling to Ireland many times for work and way before the internet craze and ability to purchase on Amazon. I couldn't find it in the States and had to use it sparingly.  It is the only perfume or scent I can wear that does not give me a headache.  I have always been given compliments when wearing it. The first time I smelled it I felt like it was my own personal creation and was so excited to find it.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-1","r":5.0,"t":"Love the travel size....","x":"I discovered this amazing scent while touring Ireland a few years ago and having been wearing it ever since then. My most favorite thing is the look on the faces of those interested in purchasing it and I tell them I found it on vacation and it\u2019s not available locally......That\u2019s Our Little Secret, Amazon!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love the scent, not the bag","x":"The inis line is wonderful, feel like I got jipped with the bag. What I received did not match up with what was pictured. Way lesser quality, kinda disappointed","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-3","r":3.0,"t":"Fresh, but short lived","x":"Absolutely love the fragrance, but it doesn't last long.  Shower gel could be thicker and the hand lotion does not smell as fragrant as the body lotion.  Even when I layer the product the scent doesn't last.  I will make one last try by ordering the oil and layering it in hopes that the scent lasts longer.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-4","r":5.0,"t":"2.9oz not 29oz for body lotion and shower gel. Smells great!","x":"This is the best smelling fragrance! I bought it for my friend for her birthday who is about to go on a trip. There is a discrepancy in the sizes for the shower gel and body lotion though. You will receive a 2.9 ounce bottle of each NOT 29. That was kind of disappointing.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-5","r":5.0,"t":"After shower. GREAT","x":"How about a powder for after shower No Takl","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-6","r":5.0,"t":"Light, clean, and fresh","x":"EXCELLENT value and product! Great way to try inis. I sampled this in the Keys, and knew I had to buy it. I have severe allergies, and am unable to use most perfumes, body spray, lotion, etc. This is light & fresh & does NOT bother my sinuses; my new go-to scent! Plus, it\u2019s affordable, and really does remind me of the sea. \ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\udc99","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-7","r":5.0,"t":"Favorite perfume, great travel size","x":"This is one of my favorite perfumes and everyone always complements me on it. It\u2019s scent is fresh and crisp, no floral or candy odor to it. The travel pack is great for traveling, it\u2019s the right size and the bag it comes in is high quality","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-8","r":5.0,"t":"Absolutely fabulous scent","x":"I am not a person that likes floral  strong scents  the smell of this perfume is clean and fresh and I love it got my sister to be a fan of it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-9","r":5.0,"t":"Smells wonderful","x":"I really enjoy the scent of INIS.  The gift set is great!  The cost is appropriate.  I will buy this again for my travels.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-10","r":5.0,"t":"Light scent","x":"I use this daily but didn\u2019t want to take the large size ion the flight ! This combination was perfect!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value","x":"Everything you need for traveling with a clean, fresh scent.  Speedy delivery too!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-12","r":5.0,"t":"Delightful Fragrance","x":"Love the fragrances. Love the way the body and hand lotions go on. Very silky.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-13","r":5.0,"t":"Love the scent.","x":"Love the scent. So glad it comes in a travel pack.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-14","r":5.0,"t":"Love this Inis-Scent of Ireland Travel Set","x":"After visiting Ireland twice in 2019-2020, my daughter found this scent on our way home 1/2020 at Duty Free or while we were in Ireland and tried it.  She found it on Amazon and I have purchased the travel set and bathroom set for myself and my best friend.  Travel set comes in a really nice blue satchel. It makes a perfect gift!  Lovely fragrance!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-15","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE LOVE LOVE this little bag of goodies!","x":"Thank you for providing this little bag of Inis products.  Great scent - so fresh.  I like the variety of products ... I decided to keep it for myself, rather than give as a gift.  Arrived on time, well packaged, great quality.  I will order this again.  THANKS!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great Scent!","x":"I received this as a gift and being Irish was delighted.  Great for men and women.  Nice clean scent.  Makes you feel like you\u2019re seaside!!  Will certainly order this again for myself and as a gift for my Irish friends!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-17","r":5.0,"t":"Sister Loves This","x":"Sister was out of state and saw this in a store but couldn\u2019t afford to buy it for herself. I Looked on Amazon and OF COURSE they had it so I bought it for her! She loved it and now I do too. Gotta buy one for me now!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-18","r":5.0,"t":"Favorite Scent","x":"Inis is hard to get, love that Amazon stocks this product and can be received quickly once the order is placed.  Thank you amazon for having hard to find items available on line for a reasonable price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-19","r":5.0,"t":"Obsessed with this perfume!","x":"This perfume is wonderful. The smell of it is so clean \ud83d\ude0d  it's probably one of my favorites. I like to switch it up and wear different ones every day. But this one is definitely my go to.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-20","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect gift for the traveler","x":"This will be a birthday gift for a person who travels and the scent is very fresh and reminiscent of the sea. I love this scent.  It could be used by men or women, in my opinion.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-21","r":5.0,"t":"She won't use anything else!","x":"I bought this scent for my granddaughter years ago and to this day, she won't use anything else! She loves it and calls it \"her\" scent. It does smell wonderful!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-22","r":4.0,"t":"Everything one Needs","x":"Smelled exactly as I\u2019d remembered. Clean and crisp. Adorable, very roomy little bag everything came in, perfect for traveling. Glad I found this!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-23","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!","x":"My thoughtful sister gifted me with this!  It's so beautiful, I love the fragrance, the colors, the packaging.  It is a perfect gift.  Thank you!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07N4BT9LL-24","r":5.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"I love the scent. However, the lotion bottle was broken and lotion was all over the bag and other products. Had to throw the bag and lotion away.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the clean, fresh, light scent of the product.","cites":[1,2,7,8,9,10,11,12,13,14]},{"text":"Many customers value the travel-size set as convenient and well-suited for trips.","cites":[2,8,10,11,12,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the scent does not last long, even when layered.","cites":[4]},{"text":"A few customers were disappointed that the bag or packaging did not match the picture or expected quality.","cites":[3]},{"text":"Some reviewers noted a size discrepancy, receiving 2.9 oz instead of the listed 29 oz for the shower gel and body lotion.","cites":[5]}]},"qa":[]}